{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19107290","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19107290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910729001:1":{"text":"이 기포들은... 왜 사방에 흩어져 있는 걸까? 누가 흩어 놓은 걸까?","source_cn":"这些气泡……为什么散落一地？是谁把它们打散了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35F15A0887D11DD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910729002:1":{"text":"그건... 중요하지 않다. 여기선... 무슨 일이 일어나도 이상하지 않으니...","source_cn":"这……不重要。这里……出现什么都不奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0874D2A7649C1CA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910729003:1":{"text":"이 건물, 이 기포들... 머릿속에... 떠오른 그 광경들...","source_cn":"这座建筑，这些气泡……那些……出现在脑中的景象……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBADAFF43ACE25304","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910729004:1":{"text":"그... 소리까지...!","source_cn":"那些……声音……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B16A17AE1F89FB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910729005:1":{"text":"칼릭스, 괜찮아? 너...","source_cn":"卡律先生！你还好吗，你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF04E671DE8CBE9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910729006:1":{"text":"...멈추지 마!","source_cn":"……不要停下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB242B96B892FA464","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910729007:1":{"text":"소리가... 너무 시끄럽다. 그 소리가... 우리를 완전히 집어삼키기 전에 기포들을 모아서... 여길 떠나야 해!","source_cn":"声音……太吵了。在它……填满我们之前，收集那些气泡……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8300D9CBA35480A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:艾菲拉":{"text":"엘피라","source":"艾菲拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡律":{"text":"칼릭스","source":"卡律","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}